295
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:47,840
Don't be nervous.

296
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:49,840
I'm here.

297
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,400
Sign closer.

298
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:41,440
Put our names together.

299
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:43,240
Is that okay?

300
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:45,520
Should we avoid suspicion and space them out?

301
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,800
Did you forget what Director Chen said?

302
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:50,080
Sign openly.

303
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:22,400
Still not used to it?

304
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:26,120
It feels a little unreal.

305
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,376
After all, I've wanted to walk a red carpet

306
00:22:28,400 --> 00:22:29,400
for a long time.

307
00:22:31,560 --> 00:22:32,560
You'll get used to it.

308
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:34,840
Bro.

309
00:22:34,993 --> 00:22:36,809
Something happened.
You two need to leave now.

310
00:22:36,840 --> 00:22:37,879
Get security here.

311
00:22:38,480 --> 00:22:39,120
What happened?
Bro.

312
00:22:39,600 --> 00:22:40,200
Let's get out first.

313
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:41,296
Go. The car is waiting in the back.

314
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:42,320
Right.

315
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:48,720
Stop filming.

316
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:58,720
You two,

317
00:22:58,920 --> 00:23:01,400
photos of you watching a
late night movie together are online.

318
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:35,296
Have you two confirmed your relationship?

319
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:36,160
May I ask,
is it true, as online rumors say,

320
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:37,960
that you fell in love while filming?

321
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,040
Make way, make way.

322
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:40,720
Tell us something.

323
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:04,760
Stop pushing,

324
00:24:04,800 --> 00:24:06,040
Spread out everyone, stay safe!

325
00:24:29,120 --> 00:24:30,120
Hello?

326
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,160
Zhun.

327
00:24:31,360 --> 00:24:34,160
Why haven't you called Grandma in so long?

328
00:24:34,280 --> 00:24:34,840
Grandma.

329
00:24:35,160 --> 00:24:36,160
I've been filming.

330
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:37,440
It's been busy, so I didn't...

331
00:24:37,520 --> 00:24:38,520
Oh.

332
00:24:40,120 --> 00:24:42,520
The TV has been talking about you lately.

333
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:44,000
I saw it all.

334
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:46,640
Is it true?

335
00:24:51,600 --> 00:24:52,600
Zhun.

336
00:24:53,800 --> 00:24:56,000
I don't expect you to bring glory to the family

337
00:24:56,026 --> 00:24:57,106
or become someone great.

338
00:24:58,040 --> 00:25:00,200
I just hope you're safe,

339
00:25:00,560 --> 00:25:01,880
steady,

340
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:04,520
and living happily.

341
00:25:06,320 --> 00:25:07,760
But the way you are now,

342
00:25:09,040 --> 00:25:10,760
are you happy?

343
00:25:11,040 --> 00:25:12,040
Grandma.

344
00:25:12,520 --> 00:25:13,840
I'm pretty happy now.

345
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:20,160
Happy?

346
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:26,480
As long as you're happy.

347
00:25:27,840 --> 00:25:29,360
As long as you're happy,

348
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:31,840
when I go underground one day,

349
00:25:32,040 --> 00:25:34,120
I can answer to your parents.

350
00:25:37,760 --> 00:25:38,760
Zhun...?

351
00:25:40,560 --> 00:25:40,960
Zhun...?

352
00:25:41,360 --> 00:25:42,360
Grandma.

353
00:25:45,360 --> 00:25:46,360
Are you crying?

354
00:25:47,120 --> 00:25:49,320
Did Grandma say something wrong?

355
00:25:54,600 --> 00:25:55,600
Grandma.

356
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:57,720
You didn't do anything wrong.

357
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:00,680
Zhun.

358
00:26:01,280 --> 00:26:02,040
Whatever others say,

359
00:26:02,080 --> 00:26:03,320
we'll pretend we don't hear it.

360
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:05,360
Every family lives its own life.

361
00:26:07,120 --> 00:26:09,240
But this thing with you and Danyi...

362
00:26:09,320 --> 00:26:10,320
Grandma.

363
00:26:10,520 --> 00:26:11,680
Let me talk to him.

364
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:17,440
The neighbors are all talking.

365
00:26:18,360 --> 00:26:19,520
I really couldn't stop them.

366
00:26:21,120 --> 00:26:22,120
I'm sorry.

367
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:25,040
Thank you for being with my family.

368
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,400
Zhang Zhun.

369
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:30,200
This is the second time.

370
00:26:31,360 --> 00:26:33,400
You're gambling everything you have.

371
00:26:35,560 --> 00:26:36,560
Danyi.

372
00:26:38,080 --> 00:26:39,080
Turn back.

373
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,040
Grandma and I will wait you at home

374
00:26:46,840 --> 00:26:47,840
No matter...

375
00:26:53,800 --> 00:26:54,800
No matter what,

376
00:26:57,080 --> 00:26:58,280
I won't come back.

377
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:03,560
I'm sorry.

378
00:27:29,960 --> 00:27:33,280
Zhen, blink if this schemer has trapped you.

379
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:36,080
The film's shameless hype is disgusting!

380
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:38,160
Zhang Zhun looks pathetic throwing himself at him.

381
00:27:38,200 --> 00:27:39,736
He'd lose all dignity just to get famous.

382
00:27:39,760 --> 00:27:41,840
Zhen Xin used to date gorgeous women.

383
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:43,256
He'd have to be blind to choose you.

384
00:27:43,280 --> 00:27:45,600
He makes one gay film and thinks he's gay now?

385
00:27:45,840 --> 00:27:46,840
Disgusting marketing.

386
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:47,880
Boycott the film.

387
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:50,000
Zhang Zhun, get out of showbiz.

388
00:27:50,040 --> 00:27:51,520
Don't taint our Zhen.

389
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:03,520
I'll have my team
suppress these comments.

390
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,800
Just like the fifty-million rumor before.

391
00:28:07,480 --> 00:28:08,480
Don't be afraid.

392
00:28:09,840 --> 00:28:11,440
Your birthday is on the fifth next month.

393
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:12,760
What gift do you want?

394
00:28:30,040 --> 00:28:31,040
Hello, Qin.

395
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:33,920
You don't have to say it.

396
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:35,240
I won't agree.

397
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:39,360
Arranging a new rumored girlfriend right
after my breakup?

398
00:28:39,760 --> 00:28:41,960
How is that any better than watching a movie with a man?

399
00:28:43,560 --> 00:28:45,200
What do you mean we won't have a future?

400
00:28:45,520 --> 00:28:47,240
You're you. We're us.

401
00:28:50,440 --> 00:28:51,440
That's right.

402
00:28:52,120 --> 00:28:53,120
He and I are together.

403
00:28:54,280 --> 00:28:55,360
We're gay.

404
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:56,440
Are you satisfied now?

405
00:28:57,760 --> 00:28:58,760
What are you doing?

406
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:00,960
Coming out.

407
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:03,560
I, Zhen Xin, own what I do.

408
00:29:04,840 --> 00:29:05,840
No.

409
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:06,520
Absolutely not.

410
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:07,640
Why not?

411
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:10,160
Do you regret it?

412
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:12,400
No.

413
00:29:13,320 --> 00:29:14,320
I don't regret it.

414
00:29:15,986 --> 00:29:17,042
But we still can't come out.

415
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,080
Why can't we?

416
00:29:19,840 --> 00:29:20,880
I can't be that selfish.

417
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:23,520
I still have Grandma,

418
00:29:23,560 --> 00:29:24,560
and my family.

419
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,400
You still have me.

420
00:29:31,320 --> 00:29:32,520
Am I supposed to live off you?

421
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:36,400
Do you have endless fifty millions?

422
00:29:37,760 --> 00:29:38,760
Zhen Xin.

423
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:42,400
Besides all that,

424
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:45,120
I have to think about my family.

425
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:47,080
We live our own lives.

426
00:29:47,120 --> 00:29:48,376
What does it have to do with them?

427
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:49,640
This is between us.

428
00:29:51,280 --> 00:29:52,280
My dad died early.

429
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:56,360
My mom died of illness when I was thirteen.

430
00:29:58,840 --> 00:30:01,680
My grandma raised me in a small county town.

431
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:07,200
No matter how hard it got, I never saw her cry once.

432
00:30:10,800 --> 00:30:11,880
But yesterday, she and...

433
00:30:18,120 --> 00:30:19,120
Anyway,

434
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:21,600
I don't want to see her, at her age,

435
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:24,600
unable to even hold her head up outside.

436
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:25,880
We can get through it.

437
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:27,400
Think of Gao Zhun and Fang Chi.

438
00:30:27,760 --> 00:30:28,720
They were so desperate back then.

439
00:30:28,760 --> 00:30:29,976
Didn't they get through it too?

440
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:31,080
We can too.

441
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:32,280
That's fiction.

442
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:33,880
It's fantasy. It's a script.

443
00:30:34,080 --> 00:30:35,680
It can't happen in real life.

444
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:36,600
The story is fake.

445
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,080
The feelings are real.

446
00:30:45,080 --> 00:30:46,440
You're too deep in character.

447
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,600
I'm too deep in character?

448
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:52,720
Did you forget who called me Fang Chi off set?

449
00:30:54,040 --> 00:30:55,040
When?

450
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,240
Can you really say

451
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:14,760
we weren't in character?

452
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:23,880
Yes.

453
00:31:24,560 --> 00:31:25,560
We were in character.

454
00:31:27,800 --> 00:31:28,800
There's one week left.

455
00:31:30,560 --> 00:31:31,720
Then filming wraps.

456
00:31:34,320 --> 00:31:35,320
We...

457
00:31:40,560 --> 00:31:41,960
We should get out of character too.

458
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:11,880
Come on.
You guys.

459
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:14,840
Take a look at how you've been these past few days.

460
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:18,600
We wrap in four and a half days.

461
00:32:18,993 --> 00:32:21,233
The rest are all big emotional scenes.

462
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:23,760
Things have been heated these days.

463
00:32:24,280 --> 00:32:25,680
And you're all a little off.

464
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:28,440
How about we add a table read tonight?

465
00:32:28,840 --> 00:32:29,840
Get immersed.

466
00:32:30,840 --> 00:32:31,840
Sort out the emotions.

467
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:34,800
Director Chen, I have plans tonight.

468
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:37,280
If it's a table read, do it daytime or another day.

469
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:38,400
Zhou Zheng.

470
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:39,720
Arrange it.

471
00:32:39,920 --> 00:32:40,560
Adjust the schedule.
Table read first.

472
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:42,800
We'll read now.

473
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:43,960
Okay

474
00:32:46,760 --> 00:32:47,040
Come on.

475
00:32:47,280 --> 00:32:49,160
Let's turn to Scene 88 first.

476
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:50,480
Look at this scene.

477
00:32:51,320 --> 00:32:54,560
[From Grandma:] No matter how busy you are, call Danyi.

478
00:32:59,323 --> 00:33:01,249
[We've already broken up]

479
00:33:07,760 --> 00:33:08,760
Okay.

480
00:33:14,840 --> 00:33:15,840
I was wrong.

481
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:17,200
I wasn't calm.

482
00:33:21,520 --> 00:33:22,680
Whatever you say, I'll do it.

483
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:24,160
We'll be together anyway.

484
00:33:24,360 --> 00:33:25,360
I'll listen to you.

485
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:29,280
Do you know what you look like now?

486
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:31,920
Like a proud leopard

487
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:35,760
begging for a hug inside.

488
00:33:48,800 --> 00:33:49,960
Put your phones away.

489
00:33:50,280 --> 00:33:51,280
It's table read time.

490
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:04,200
Did you just come back from some big event?

491
00:34:06,080 --> 00:34:07,520
There is an important event tonight.

492
00:34:17,160 --> 00:34:17,720
Wait for me.

493
00:34:18,040 --> 00:34:19,040
I'll be ready soon.

494
00:34:49,440 --> 00:34:50,440
Zhang Zhun.

495
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,000
Will you

496
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:59,200
spend the rest of your life with me?

497
00:38:44,680 --> 00:38:46,400
Is this his confession setup?

498
00:38:55,520 --> 00:38:56,520
Passcode...

499
00:38:56,680 --> 00:38:58,240
It couldn't be my birthday, right?
